<title>AUSTRIA: OPEC to have develop new quota monitor mechanism.</title>
<headline>OPEC to have develop new quota monitor mechanism.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Libyan oil minister Abdullah Salem al-Badri said that OPEC was to have a new mechanism to monitor output quotas over the next six months.</p>
<p>&quot;We are trying to develop a new method for monitoring the quotas but there will be a stand-by mechanism,&quot; he said.</p>
</text>
